<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::military_engagement_rate" target="global_energy_shift::seaborne_flow_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher tempo and scale of kinetic operations (strikes, blockades, interdictions) directly damages terminals, forces port closures and no-sail advisories, and prompts cancellations that reduce the volume of oil and LNG actually moved by sea.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::military_engagement_rate" target="market_monetary_stress::fiscal_financing_pressur" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in kinetic engagements raise defense and emergency spending while prompting investor risk premia on sovereign debt, tightening rollover conditions and increasing fiscal financing pressure for affected states.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">market_monetary_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::military_engagement_rate" target="russia_ukraine_war::strike_frequency" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high-rate kinetic operations by US and Western forces in the Iran–US theatre increase immediate demand on precision munitions and logistics, prompting reallocation or slower deliveries of weapons to Ukraine and thereby reducing Ukrainian-capable strike frequency.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::military_engagement_rate" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::capital_flow_to_ai" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in kinetic operations raises geopolitical and market risk premiums, prompting global investors and venture funds to pull back or reallocate capital away from high‑growth civilian AI ventures (and cross‑border tech deals), lowering short‑term financing into AI projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
