<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::maritime_chokepoint_sec" target="market_monetary_stress::inflation_expectations" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in threats or attacks at Strait of Hormuz and other regional chokepoints acutely raises oil and shipping-cost premia, which markets quickly translate into higher near- and medium-term inflation expectations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">market_monetary_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::maritime_chokepoint_sec" target="russia_ukraine_war::energy_price_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Deterioration in security around key chokepoints (Red Sea, Bab al-Mandeb, Suez approaches) forces rerouting, increases insurance and freight costs and injects uncertainty into delivery schedules, which raises short- to medium-term volatility in energy prices affecting markets linked to the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_regional_war::maritime_chokepoint_sec" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::chip_production_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained attacks and higher insurance/closure risks in key waterways (Red Sea/Strait of Hormuz/Bab el‑Mandeb) directly disrupt shipments of specialty gases, substrates and finished semiconductor components, forcing fabs to curtail output or delay production runs and reducing near‑term chip capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_regional_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
