  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher frequency/intensity of kinetic strikes (missile, drone, naval gunfire) in the theatre increases the number of hostile incidents that hit or threaten merchant energy shipping and offshore energy infrastructure, raising the measured maritime attack incidence rate.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
