  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Reduced liquid-fuel flows from Russia force rerouting and increased crude/product shipments out of the Persian Gulf and via alternative long-haul routes, raising tanker density, transit congestion and exposure at the Strait of Hormuz and Suez and thereby degrading chokepoint security.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_us_regional_war</data>
</edge>
