  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Intensified allied political support produces coordinated sanctions and export-control packages and institutional templates that are adapted/expanded to tighten AI and semiconductor export and inspection regimes vis-à-vis China.</data>
