  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher high‑performance compute capacity directly enables development and deployment of AI‑guided autonomous maritime drones and faster, more effective cyber targeting tools that increase the frequency of successful hostile incidents against energy shipping.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
