  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid increases in allied compute capacity enable faster training and deployment of ISR/targeting AI that is shared with Ukraine, improving target discovery and operational tempo and thereby increasing Ukrainian strike frequency.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
