  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden fall in advanced chip output raises semiconductor and downstream durable‑goods prices and lengthens supply bottlenecks, which markets incorporate into higher near‑term inflation expectations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
