  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster deployment of AI in voyage planning and risk forecasting lets ship operators and charterers anticipate hazards and optimize dynamic routing, reducing the frequency of abrupt, longer alternative routings for energy shipments.</data>
