  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster fielding of AI-assisted ISR, targeting aids, and automated command‑and‑control shortens decision cycles and can produce faster, more automated responses to perceived threats, increasing the chance of rapid reciprocal escalation between U.S. forces and Iranian forces/proxies.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_us_regional_war</data>
