  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher rates of rerouting increase transit times and freight costs for critical fab inputs (EUV tools, specialty chemicals, substrates), causing missed wafer starts and temporary fab slowdowns that reduce effective chip output.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
