  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising fiscal financing pressure forces governments to cut or delay subsidies, tax incentives, and public guarantees that underwrite expensive fab builds, reducing near‑term additions to advanced semiconductor production capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">market_monetary_stress</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
