  <data key="d37">An upward revision in expected policy rates typically strengthens the dollar and tightens global liquidity, squeezing Iran's access to hard currency and prompting Tehran to increase reliance on and activation of proxies to project influence and offset economic pressure.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
